good, very good, yay!"

00:01:25.277 --> 00:01:26.263
(laughing)

00:01:26.263 --> 00:01:27.204
Try it.

00:01:27.204 --> 00:01:30.965
- [All together] Very
good, very good, yay!

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:32.220
